<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\quiet-residential-area1.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "800" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\外廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>On the outside walkway, there was no sign of <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\マンション入り口.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\鍵を置く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
I put the key in the mailbox for <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s home.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It has a dial lock, so no one but the Niimuras can open it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\駐輪場.gal" "WAIT" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s bike had been left sitting in the bike parking area.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If she forgot even her phone, she probably didn't have her bike key either.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
―For a while, I walked along the prefectural road.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "My_life_Without_Your_Love.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\コンビニ昼.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
5 minutes later, I arrived at the convenience store nearest to home.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
On the bench in front of the convenience store―
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
sat <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just as I'd expected. I haven't been her best friend all these years <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="だて">for nothing</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Without a word, I stood beside <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Uh... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Sorry..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I sat down on the bench too, and looked closely at <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s half-lowered face, <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="のぞ">peering</STYLE> in.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Me too, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, the moment I thought you were acting strange, I should have noticed. I'm sorry."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, it's wrong for you to apologize... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Huh?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">　Is it okay for you to be outside?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah, I seem to be doing well today. Staying shut up at home all the time would be even less healthy, anyway."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"If so, that's good..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>, at last, showed me a faint smile.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, since we're out anyway, let's take a little walk. It's exactly at times like this that you have to get some fresh air!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey now, is that any way for </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">an April-sickness patient</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> to talk?" [TN: A pun on gogatsu-byo, 'May sickness,' Japan's term for the May blues.]</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We laughed together a little.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"If you like, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, should we go to Central Park, since you wanted to go?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"No, on foot it's really too far, so just wandering around here is fine. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Oh! </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, what about the house key!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I locked up and put it in the mailbox."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Haah, then it's all right."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> showed an expression of <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="あんど">relief</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
But,<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh! I forgot my phone!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah, I noticed it was there, but I didn't want us to miss each other, so I left it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Come to think of it, I had forgotten my phone too. All I had was my wallet.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hmm, forget my phone, I don't even have my wallet or keys... I embarrassed myself a while ago trying to buy a drink..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Ahaha! Wait here a sec."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自動ドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\店出入り.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "800" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
Saying so, I went into the convenience store.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I know <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s favorite drink.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\コンビニ昼.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Here!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\超炭酸.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "550" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I put a Super Soda Bomber into <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s hand.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Packed in a thick can just like an oxygen tank, a super, 
{PAUSE ""}
super 
{PAUSE ""}
super 
{PAUSE ""}
super 
{PAUSE ""}
intense carbonated drink.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Other people rate it terribly, but <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> loves it and drinks it often.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For someone who can't handle spicy food, she apparently likes this kind of thing.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ooh! That's my </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">best friend</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! Thank you!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I stared at the face of <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>, happily about to open the cap.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"What is it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"No, it's nothing!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Weirdo."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> gave the Super Soda Bomber's cap a hard twist.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\追加分\ペットボトルふた生音.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\噴出音.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\超炭酸ボンバー噴射.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "550" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
With force, the liquid inside spurted out straight at <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s face.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Bwahpff!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Ahahahaha!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Cough! </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! You totally shook it before you handed it over!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Who knooows!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As you may have guessed, I actually did shake it, just a little, out of mischief.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">'s</STYLE> clothes and head were sopping wet.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"What do you think you're doing!</STYLE> <STYLE ID="1">All that precious fizz is gone!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"That's what you're upset about?!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Apparently she minded the fizz going flat more than her clothes and head getting dirty.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Fizz is this drink's life, isn't it!? Wasting that fizz is nothing but </STYLE><STYLE ID="7" RUBY="ぼうとく">blasphemy</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Geez, really, why is there nobody who understands this!"</STYLE><PG>
Holding forth on and on, passionately, about the wonders of fizz that no one could understand: <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I listened to it, chiming in with a yes, yes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With her face, hair and clothes still <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="ぬ">soaked</STYLE>, the sight of her passionately going on about the wonders of fizz was terribly comical.
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "44" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
―Maybe satisfied after saying her piece, <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> looked up at the sky.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Somehow, I just remembered something from way back. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">When we were little, back when you still didn't hate cherry blossoms, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, we drank juice together at hanami, didn't we."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Did... we?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"That time too, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you spilled my juice. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I bawled my eyes out, but </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you just looked blank, like you didn't know what had happened..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I don't remember that at all. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Or rather, sorry, to think I did something like that..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hahaha! I'm not blaming you, I said! It just takes me back, that's all."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"My dad passed away a long time ago. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you probably don't remember, but it was while we were living here, in an accident."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, that's what started it, and right after the accident we ended up moving. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Megasawa was closer to my dad's family home than here, and there was a good hospital to heal </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">my mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s heart. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you didn't understand any of it, and because I was moving away... you bawled before I left."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Was it like that..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Sorry, for not telling you until now. A lot happened, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">my mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> told me not to say anything. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Unhappy things like that, we'd tell after we grew up, she said."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"No, thank you for telling me. Now, no more secrets, right!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "WAIT" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah... right..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seemed to me that <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s face clouded over.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There must still be something she can't say.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But, that's something <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> can tell me whenever she feels like telling it.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... We'll always be friends, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> suddenly turned to me with a serious look.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Y-yeah!</STYLE> <STYLE ID="3">Of course!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I answered with a smile, but in contrast, <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s face clouded over even more, and she looked down.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "WAIT" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Thank you... I'm glad you're my best friend, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... Because I can't live without you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, if it's something that would make you feel better to tell me, say it anytime, okay? I don't know if I can help, but..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah, thank you..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, I have a favor to ask!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s eyes, tears had <STYLE ID="10" RUBY="た">welled</STYLE> up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"My... my selfish wish, I want you to hear it..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"What is it? You can say anything, okay?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Just for today... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">until tomorrow morning, I want you to stay with me, just the two of us."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh...?</STYLE>
